      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Thanks for surfacing this issue. We've discussed this internally and for now this edge case won't be specifically supported (sorry). The Drag action requires the Menu action set to be active, which could potentially change behavior which could be counterproductive to debugging purposes. In theory a Vive user could set up some binds (pretty different to how the defaults are set up) which handle grab and interact differently to be able to use the new debug menu if necessary.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
