      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6161a61a2c0de966b4e43486|full_name} Understandable. \n\nFor the rare Vive user that comes across this in the future:\n\nMake a temp usable bind with this by moving the Global Action set `Grab` Action over to another button or different input method (like double click)",
