  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The new debug UI introduced with 1768 is unusable with vive wands because trigger is `Grab` for us. It picks up the UI when we attempt to interact with it. If possible, grabbing the UI should use the `Drag` SteamVR Action since this is bound to the grips on controllers.",
